5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Let's pick something fun! I want to know about the all-in rates against meals bought separately and what separately booked rooms cost last time.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree we need clarity on costs. I'll look into pricing of offshore houses let whole and valley inn rates versus urban beds.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to understand our group dynamic better. I'll check time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I'm concerned about the travel time. I'll investigate ferry sailings and train time, and getting around by train and bus.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll look at bathing hours and bathroom provision, and inn mealtimes and room arrangements.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
