30,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"All-in rates mean everyone pays the same regardless of appetite, but separate rooms last time had a huge price difference between us!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The offshore houses are quite cheap per head, but the valley inns are more expensive since they include breakfast and dinner.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It seems last year we were too separate, but in a shared house, there was absolutely no privacy for anyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ferry takes two whole days of our trip. The train to the spa valley is much faster, only ninety minutes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The inn has strict mealtimes and we'd all be in one room on futons. The island houses only have one bathroom.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if the island house is cheap, maybe that's better? But I don't want people paying different amounts for rooms.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, a whole house would be one bill divided evenly. However, the city beds are very expensive and meals are extra.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, if the ferry takes two days, that feels like a lot of wasted time. What about the city or the valley?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"The city is the most efficient for movement. The valley bus is limited, but still better than a ferry schedule.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't like the idea of one bathroom for all of us. And the inn's shared room sounds... overwhelming.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, would a city break be better? You'd have your own door!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Victoria,,A city break sounds expensive and fragmented. The all-in nature of the inn or the house is more predictable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Midori,,"If we want to actually spend time together without feeling crowded, maybe the city is too loose?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The city allows us to move without planning. The ferry is too restrictive. I'm leaning away from the island.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think I'd prefer a city room. Having a door and no timetable would help me sleep better.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I just want it to be fair! A shared house or an all-in inn seems easiest for the money.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I prefer the all-in rates of the inn or the single bill of the house to avoid surprises.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Midori,,Let's consider the balance. The valley inn seems like a middle ground for togetherness and ease.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I value my time. The train to the valley is fast. The island is out for me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the inn's shared room, but the island bathroom sounds worse.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
