55,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I like the idea of the Hot Spring Town! It sounds cozy and the payment is simple.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,The Hot Spring Town is predictable. I know exactly what the cost is per person.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Midori,,I think the Hot Spring Town offers the best balance of group time and accessibility.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The train time to the valley is the most efficient. I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm still nervous about the room, but the city is too expensive. I'll go with the Hot Spring Town.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Sakura,,Everyone seems to agree!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Victoria,,It is the most rational choice given the constraints.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we found a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
